{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52589","headline":"三五七言体诗 · 高迈","name":"三五七言体诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风清，秋月明。\n落叶聚还散，寒乌栖复惊。\n相思相晃知何日，此时此夜难爲情。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十五《炙毂子诗格》引）（按：《全唐诗》卷一八四收此诗爲李白诗，然《才调集》卷十收作无名氏诗，严羽《沧浪诗话》则以爲郑世翼作，杨齐贤、王琦定爲李白作，未举证。\n今人詹鍈《李诗辨僞》以爲非李白作，论证甚详瞻。\n《炙毂子诗格》晚唐王叡作。\n时去高迈、李白时代甚近，其说当可信。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高迈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}